<p>Both new and older Harvest homes can have fascia damage. Newer homes with failing builder gutters develop rot when those gutters leak. Older homes may have decades of accumulated moisture damage.</p>

<p>We find hidden rot regularly during gutter estimates. The paint looks fine from the ground, but the wood underneath is soft and failing.</p>
